---
title: Shared command drawer
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Ready
    Ready --> Running : Run
    Running --> Checking : Exit 0
    Running --> Failed : Nonzero or launch error
    Checking --> Closing : Check passed
    Checking --> Failed : Check needs attention
    Closing --> Closed : After 1.5 seconds
    Failed --> Closed : Close drawer
    Closed --> History : Show output
    History --> Closed : Close drawer
    classDef ok stroke-width:1.6px
    classDef fail stroke-width:1.6px
    classDef wait stroke-width:1.6px
    class Closing ok
    class Failed fail
    class Checking wait
    note right of Running
        Closing hides the drawer.
        The command keeps running.
    end note
